+The expected color $\hat{C}(\mathbf{r})$ of a camera ray $\mathbf{r}$ is computed via numerical quadrature [S1, unofficial]:
 $$
 \hat{C}(\mathbf{r}) = \sum_{i=1}^{N} T(t_i) (1 - \exp(-\sigma(t_i)\delta_i)) c(t_i)
 $$
